 
 
 
 

mcp   fastmcp  greeter  

greetings  dict str  str     
     english    hello  
     spanish    ¡hola  
     french    bonjour  
     japanese    こんにちは  
     arabic    مرحبا  
 


 mcp tool app greet 
    name  str 
    language  literal  english    spanish    french    japanese    arabic      english  
  -  column 
     
    word   greetings language column gap 3  css p-8 view 
        heading f  word    name    
        muted  greeting rendered fastmcp  
        badge language view


farewells  dict str  str     
     english    goodbye  
     spanish    adiós  
     french    au revoir  
     japanese    さようなら  
     arabic    مع السلامة  
 


 mcp tool app farewell 
    name  str 
    language  literal  english    spanish    french    japanese    arabic      english  
  -  column 
     
    word   farewells language column gap 3  css p-8 view 
        heading f  word    name    
        muted  farewell rendered fastmcp  
        badge language view name         main    
    mcp run  
  examples apps greet server